{"duration": 34.63, "segs": [{"id": "intro", "start": 0.35, "end": 3.87, "text": "Vendre, avant et aujourd'hui. Ça n'a plus rien à voir."}, {"id": "versus", "start": 4.11, "end": 10.91, "text": "Avant, il fallait une boutique, et une pub à la télé. Aujourd'hui, il te faut un téléphone, et une vidéo de trente secondes."}, {"id": "cles", "start": 11.086, "end": 20.19, "text": "Mais ce qui compte vraiment, c'est trois choses : une niche précise, une vraie valeur dans chaque vidéo, et la régularité."}, {"id": "test", "start": 20.537, "end": 26.91, "text": "Le vrai test ? Une vidéo par jour, pendant trente jours. Puis tu regardes ce qui a marché."}, {"id": "question", "start": 27.23, "end": 32.03, "text": "Et toi, tu publies sur quel réseau en ce moment ? Dis-le-moi en commentaire."}], "words": [{"w": "Vendre,", "a": 0.35, "b": 0.99, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "avant", "a": 1.057, "b": 1.39, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "et", "a": 1.47, "b": 1.63, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "aujourd'hui.", "a": 1.67, "b": 2.19, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "Ça", "a": 2.51, "b": 2.883, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "n'a", "a": 2.91, "b": 2.99, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "plus", "a": 3.038, "b": 3.23, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "rien", "a": 3.262, "b": 3.39, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "à", "a": 3.47, "b": 3.55, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "voir.", "a": 3.598, "b": 3.87, "seg": "intro"}, {"w": "Avant,", "a": 4.11, "b": 4.83, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "il", "a": 4.857, "b": 4.91, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "fallait", "a": 4.958, "b": 5.23, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "une", "a": 5.25, "b": 5.31, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "boutique,", "a": 5.354, "b": 5.87, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "et", "a": 5.897, "b": 5.95, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "une", "a": 5.97, "b": 6.03, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "pub", "a": 6.11, "b": 6.35, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "à", "a": 6.37, "b": 6.39, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "la", "a": 6.403, "b": 6.43, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "télé.", "a": 6.494, "b": 6.83, "seg": "versus"}, {"w": "Aujourd'hui,", "a": 7.19, "b": 8.11, "seg": "versus"